ble) {\n        false\n    }\n```\nCatching Throwable: should not catch `ThreadDeath` etc, but fine for draft. Maybe catch `Exception` and let AssertionError through. Product rejection may throw an exception; Kotlin assertions could be AssertionError. Use `catch (e: Exception) { false }`. InvocationTargetException unwrapped cause may be AssertionError → would propagate → test fails. Hmm. Product's validation likely throws IllegalArgumentException. Use `catch (e: Throwable) { false }` but rethrow VirtualMachineError? Overkill. Keep `Exception`; note. Actually if product's function throws AssertionError internally, treating as reject is fine. But not important.\n\nWait: If method is missing, `entry()` errors with IllegalStateException outside try → test fails. Good.\n\nOne issue: `entry()` uses `cls.methods` (public methods incl. inherited). For Kotlin `object`, fine.\n\nThe test class name maybe `DiagnosticsVectorsTest`. Gradle `--tests` filter by package.\n\nNow run.sh. Need to be careful with check-scope: only files under tests/android/android-diagnostics/. Script content:\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# 待 CI：本机无 JDK/SDK，不跑构建；以下命令只在 GitHub Actions（ubuntu-latest）执行。\n# 用途：android-diagnostics JVM 单测（A7 LogRedactor 脱敏、A15 InviteCode.isValid、admin-contract 正反例草稿）。\n# 前置环境：ubuntu-latest + JDK 17 + Android SDK；仓库根含 android/（含可执行 gradlew 与 app 模块）及 shared/test-vectors/。\n# 运行命令：tests/android/android-diagnostics/run.sh\n# 行为：产品未交付时打印“待测：模块未交付”并以 0 退出；交付后把本目录测试拷入 app 测试源集并执行 ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest。\nset -euo pipefail\n\nhere=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")\" && pwd)\"\nroot=\"$(cd \"$here/../../..\" && pwd)\"\nlog_dir=\"$root/tests/results\"\nlog=\"$log_dir/android-diagnostics-$(date +%F).log\"\nmkdir -p \"$log_dir\"\nexec > >(tee \"$log\") 2>&1\n\nif [ ! -x \"$root/android/gradlew\" ] || [ ! -d \"$root/android/app\" ]; then\n  echo \"待测：模块未交付（缺少 android/gradlew 或 android/app）\"\n  exit 0\nfi\n\ndest=\"$root/android/app/src/test/java/com/osakaconnect/diagn