{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_6b7TJpTPA0UIdyYIV9S40756","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/box/osaka/wt/tests/tests/android/android-diagnostics/DiagnosticsVectorsTest.kt has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5b32248-d525-4117-8e3f-453c96726101","uuid":"6b8faebd-37a0-4b25-955a-7b588e5bd535","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:03:58.270Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/home/box/osaka/wt/tests/tests/android/android-diagnostics/DiagnosticsVectorsTest.kt","oldString":" * 运行命令（待 CI；本机无 JDK/SDK，不跑构建）：tests/android/android-diagnostics/run.sh（内部 ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest）。","newString":" * 运行命令（待 CI；本机无 JDK/SDK，不跑构建）：bash tests/android/android-diagnostics/run.sh（内部 ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest）。","originalFile":"/*\n * 用途：android-diagnostics JVM 单测草稿——LogRedactor 跑 shared/test-vectors/redaction.json 全部 case（A7，与 Windows 同一份向量）；\n *       InviteCode.isValid 跑 invite-code.json 全部正反例（A15）；admin-contract.json 解析校验函数正反例（0.2.0 预检）。\n * 前置环境：ubuntu-latest + JDK 17 + Android SDK；仓库根含 shared/test-vectors/；产品 android/ 已交付。\n * 运行命令（待 CI；本机无 JDK/SDK，不跑构建）：tests/android/android-diagnostics/run.sh（内部 ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest）。\n * 覆盖 acceptance：A7、A15；admin-contract 为 notes/android-diagnostics.md 所列 0.2.0 预检项。\n * 待 CI：本文件只作草稿，未在本机编译。\n */\n\npackage com.osakaconnect.diagnostics\n\nimport org.junit.Assert.assertEquals\nimport org.junit.Assert.assertFalse\nimport org.junit.Assert.assertTrue\nimport org.junit.Assume.assumeNoException\nimport org.junit.Test\nimport java.io.File\nimport java.lang.reflect.InvocationTargetException\nimport java.lang.reflect.Method\nimport java.lang.reflect.Modifier\n\n// 产品入口：类名来自 brief；包名、方法名与返回约定待写手交付后对齐。\nprivate const val PRODUCT_PACKAGE = \"com.osakaconnect.diagnostics\" // 待写手交付后对齐\nprivate const val LOG_REDACTOR_CLASS = \"$PRODUCT_PACKAGE.LogRedactor\" // 待对齐；约定 (String) -> String\nprivate const val LOG_REDACT_METHOD = \"redact\" // 待对齐\nprivate const val INVITE_CODE_CLASS = \"$PRODUCT_PACKAGE.InviteCode\" // 待对齐\nprivate const val INVITE_IS_VALID_METHOD = \"isValid\" // 待对齐；约定 (String?) -> Boolean\nprivate const val ADMIN_CONTRACT_CLASS = \"$PRODUCT_PACKAGE.AdminContract\" // 待对齐\nprivate const val ADMIN_VALIDATE_METHOD = \"validate\" // 待对齐；约定 (rawJson: String, schemaName: String) -> Boolean?/对象/null\nprivate val ADMIN_SCHEMAS = listOf(\"HealthResponse\", \"VersionResponse\", \"ErrorBody\")\n\nclass DiagnosticsVectorsTest {\n\n    @Test\n    fun logRedactorMatchesAllRedactionVectors() {\n        val redact = entry(LOG_REDACTOR_CLASS, LOG_REDACT_METHOD, 1)\n        val cases = ((vector(\"redaction.json\") as Map<*, *>)[\"cases\"] as List<*>)\n        assertTrue(\"redaction.json 至少要有 1 个 case\", cases.isNotEmpty())\n        for (case in cases) {\n            val c = case as Map<*, *>\n            val input = c[\"in\"] as String\n            val expected = c[\"out\"] as String\n            assertEquals(\"LogRedactor 脱敏结果不符：$input\", expected, redact.invoke(input))\n        }\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun inviteCodeMatchesAllVectors() {\n        val isValid = entry(INVITE_CODE_CLASS, INVITE_IS_VALID_METHOD, 1)\n        val root = vector(\"invite-code.json\") as Map<*, *>\n        val valid = root[\"valid\"] as List<*>\n        val invalid = root[\"invalid\"] as List<*>\n        assertTrue(\"invite-code.json 缺正例\", valid.isNotEmpty())\n        assertTrue(\"invite-code.json 缺反例\", invalid.isNotEmpty())\n        for (code in valid) assertEquals(\"合法邀请码被拒：$code\", true, isValid.invoke(code))\n        for (code in invalid) assertEquals(\"非法邀请码被收：$code\", false, isValid.invoke(code))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun adminContractRejectsInvalidAndAcceptsValid() {\n        val validate = entry(ADMIN_CONTRACT_CLASS, ADMIN_VALIDATE_METHOD, 2)\n        val root = vector(\"admin-contract.json\") as Map<*, *>\n        for (schema in ADMIN_SCHEMAS) {\n            val block = root[schema] as? Map<*, *> ?: error(\"admin-contract.json 缺 $schema\")\n            for (raw in block[\"valid\"] as List<*>) {\n                val json = Json.stringify(raw)\n                assertTrue(\"$schema 合法样例被拒：$json\", isAccepted(validate, json, schema))\n            }\n            for (raw in block[\"invalid\"] as List<*>) {\n                val json = Json.stringify(raw)\n                assertFalse(\"$schema 非法样例被收：$json\", isAccepted(validate, json, schema))\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// 解析校验函数的返回约定待写手对齐：Boolean 直接采用；对象/null 按非空=收；抛异常=拒。\nprivate fun isAccepted(validate: Entry, rawJson: String, schema: String): Boolean =\n    try {\n        when (val result = validate.invoke(rawJson, schema)) {\n            is Boolean -> result\n            else -> result != null\n        }\n    } catch (e: Exception) {\n        false\n    }\n\nprivate class Entry(private val method: Method, private val owner: Any?) {\n    fun invoke(vararg args: Any?): Any? =\n        try {\n            method.invoke(owner, *args)\n        } catch (e: InvocationTargetException) {\n            throw e.targetException\n        }\n}\n\nprivate fun entry(className: String, methodName: String, arity: Int): Entry {\n    val cls: Class<*> = try {\n        Class.forName(className)\n    } catch (e: ClassNotFoundException) {\n        println(\"待测：模块未交付（$className）\")\n        assumeNoException(\"待测：模块未交付（$className）\", e)\n        error(\"unreachable\")\n    }\n    val method = cls.methods.firstOrNull { it.name == methodName && it.parameterCount == arity }\n        ?: error(\"待对齐：找不到 $className.$methodName/$arity\")\n    val owner: Any? = if (Modifier.isStatic(method.modifiers)) null else {\n        val field = cls.declaredFields.firstOrNull { it.name == \"INSTANCE\" || it.name == \"Companion\" }\n            ?: error(\"待对齐：$className.$methodName 非 static/object/companion\")\n        field.isAccessible = true\n        field.get(null)\n    }\n    return Entry(method, owner)\n}\n\n// 从 user.dir 向上找仓库根，按仓库根相对路径读向量。\nprivate fun vector(name: String): Any? {\n    var dir: File? = File(System.getProperty(\"user.dir\")).absoluteFile\n    while (dir != null) {\n        val file = File(dir, \"shared/test-vectors/$name\")\n        if (file.isFile) return Json.parse(file.readText())\n        dir = dir.parentFile\n    }\n    error(\"找不到 shared/test-vectors/$name（从 ${System.getProperty(\"user.dir\")} 向上查找）\")\n}\n\n// 不新增 JUnit 以外依赖：向量读取/回写用下面的最小 JSON 解析器。\nprivate object Json {\n    fun parse(text: String): Any? {\n        val p = Parser(text)\n        val value = p.value()\n        p.skipWs()\n        require(p.done()) { \"JSON 尾部有多余内容\" }\n        return value\n    }\n\n    fun stringify(value: Any?): String = when (value) {\n        null -> \"null\"\n        is String -> buildString {\n            append('\"')\n            for (c in value) when (c) {\n                '\"' -> append(\"\\\\\\\"\")\n                '\\\\' -> append(\"\\\\\\\\\")\n                '\\n' -> append(\"\\\\n\")\n                '\\r' -> append(\"\\\\r\")\n                '\\t' -> append(\"\\\\t\")\n                else -> if (c < ' ') append(\"\\\\u%04x\".format(c.code)) else append(c)\n            }\n            append('\"')\n        }\n        is Map<*, *> -> value.entries.joinToString(\",\", \"{\", \"}\") {\n            stringify(it.key) + \":\" + stringify(it.value)\n        }\n        is List<*> -> value.joinToString(\",\", \"[\", \"]\") { stringify(it) }\n        else -> value.toString() // 向量里除字符串外只有布尔/null/数字\n    }\n}\n\nprivate class Parser(private val s: String) {\n    private var i = 0\n\n    fun done() = i >= s.length\n\n    fun skipWs() {\n        while (i < s.length && s[i].isWhitespace()) i++\n    }\n\n    fun value(): Any? {\n        skipWs()\n        require(i < s.length) { \"JSON 意外结束\" }\n        return when (s[i]) {\n            '{' -> obj()\n            '[' -> arr()\n            '\"' -> str()\n            't' -> literal(\"true\", true)\n            'f' -> literal(\"false\", false)\n            'n' -> literal(\"null\", null)\n            else -> num()\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun obj(): Map<String, Any?> {\n        i++ // {\n        val out = LinkedHashMap<String, Any?>()\n        skipWs()\n        if (peek('}')) { i++; return out }\n        while (true) {\n            skipWs()\n            val key = str()\n            skipWs()\n            require(peek(':')) { \"JSON 缺少 :\" }\n            i++\n            out[key] = value()\n            skipWs()\n            when {\n                peek(',') -> i++\n                peek('}') -> { i++; return out }\n                else -> error(\"JSON 对象缺少 , 或 }\")\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun arr(): List<Any?> {\n        i++ // [\n        val out = ArrayList<Any?>()\n        skipWs()\n        if (peek(']')) { i++; return out }\n        while (true) {\n            out.add(value())\n            skipWs()\n            when {\n                peek(',') -> i++\n                peek(']') -> { i++; return out }\n                else -> error(\"JSON 数组缺少 , 或 ]\")\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun str(): String {\n        require(peek('\"')) { \"JSON 期望字符串\" }\n        i++\n        val out = StringBuilder()\n        while (true) {\n            require(i < s.length) { \"JSON 字符串未闭合\" }\n            when (val c = s[i++]) {\n                '\"' -> return out.toString()\n                '\\\\' -> {\n                    require(i < s.length) { \"JSON 转义未闭合\" }\n                    when (val e = s[i++]) {\n                        '\"', '\\\\', '/' -> out.append(e)\n                        'b' -> out.append('\\b')\n                        'f' -> out.append('\\u000C')\n                        'n' -> out.append('\\n')\n                        'r' -> out.append('\\r')\n                        't' -> out.append('\\t')\n                        'u' -> {\n                            require(i + 4 <= s.length) { \"JSON \\\\u 转义不完整\" }\n                            out.append(s.substring(i, i + 4).toInt(16).toChar())\n                            i += 4\n                        }\n                        else -> error(\"JSON 非法转义 \\\\$e\")\n                    }\n                }\n                else -> out.append(c)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun num(): Any {\n        val start = i\n        if (peek('-')) i++\n        while (i < s.length && (s[i].isDigit() || s[i] in \".eE+-\")) i++\n        val raw = s.substring(start, i)\n        require(raw.isNotEmpty()) { \"JSON 非法值\" }\n        return raw.toLongOrNull() ?: raw.toDouble()\n    }\n\n    private fun literal(word: String, result: Any?): Any? {\n        require(s.startsWith(word, i)) { \"JSON 非法字面量\" }\n        i += word.length\n        return result\n    }\n\n    private fun peek(c: Char) = i < s.length && s[i] == c\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":7,"newStart":2,"newLines":7,"lines":["  * 用途：android-diagnostics JVM 单测草稿——LogRedactor 跑 shared/test-vectors/redaction.json 全部 case（A7，与 Windows 同一份向量）；","  *       InviteCode.isValid 跑 invite-code.json 全部正反例（A15）；admin-contract.json 解析校验函数正反例（0.2.0 预检）。","  * 前置环境：ubuntu-latest + JDK 17 + Android SDK；仓库根含 shared/test-vectors/；产品 android/ 已交付。","- * 运行命令（待 CI；本机无 JDK/SDK，不跑构建）：tests/android/android-diagnostics/run.sh（内部 ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest）。","+ * 运行命令（待 CI；本机无 JDK/SDK，不跑构建）：bash tests/android/android-diagnostics/run.sh（内部 ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest）。","  * 覆盖 acceptance：A7、A15；admin-contract 为 notes/android-diagnostics.md 所列 0.2.0 预检项。","  * 待 CI：本文件只作草稿，未在本机编译。","  */"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_00_6b7TJpTPA0UIdyYIV9S40756","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
